
@startuml
title System Context Diagram - Roommate Matching Application

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "University Student\n(Searching for a roommate)" as Student
actor "University Student\n(Potential roommate)" as Candidate
actor "Administrator\n(Optional role)" as Admin

rectangle "Roommate Matching Application\nMobile App + Backend + ML" as System {
}

Student --> System : Register and sign in\nComplete lifestyle questionnaire\nSearch and review recommendations
Candidate --> System : Create profile\nProvide lifestyle preferences\nReview potential matches
Admin --> System : Moderate reported content\n(Future functionality)

note bottom of System
  System under development.
  The application recommends candidates;
  it does not assign accommodation.
end note

@enduml
